{"2853730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Skull and Bones", "steam_appid": 2853730, "required_age": "17", "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4464730, 4936090, 4936110, 4982800], "detailed_description": "<h1>Y3S2 Content</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras/07d2e124172d8615ba25c45d17304ba3.avif?t=1787141592\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras_big/07d2e124172d8615ba25c45d17304ba3.avif?t=1787141592 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Deluxe Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras/a70b5b1a6d6281bdef0f4e5c6a9465b4.avif?t=1787141592\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras_big/a70b5b1a6d6281bdef0f4e5c6a9465b4.avif?t=1787141592 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Deluxe Edition includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The base game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A Legendary Kingpin Boost* that unlocks three fully equipped ships and a generous pack of essential materials and resources, to kickstart your endgame journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Activating the Legendary Kingpin Boost included in the rewards will permanently replace any active Kingpin Boost on your account. The Legendary Kingpin Boost can only be activated once per account.</p></p><br><h1>Premium Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras/5778d826f9749e9a7501649bbcd40df6.avif?t=1787141592\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras_big/5778d826f9749e9a7501649bbcd40df6.avif?t=1787141592 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your experience with the Premium Edition!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The base game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- All Deluxe Edition content, including the Legendary Kingpin Boost* that unlocks three fully equipped ships and a generous pack of essential resources (with silver, upgrade kits, ascension materials, and more) to kickstart your endgame journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The Black Torch Ship Skin Set, featuring an epic new cosmetic look for your Brigantine with a wheel and emblem</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Three weapon skins, one each for culverins, demi-cannons, and long guns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A digital art book and selected game soundtrack**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Activating the Legendary Kingpin Boost included in the rewards will permanently replace any active Kingpin Boost on your account. The Legendary Kingpin Boost can only be activated once per account.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Internet connection, Ubisoft account, Microsoft Account, and Game Pass Ultimate or Core (subscriptions sold separately) required to access online multiplayer/features.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras/85c342d191f2735ce83cdd3fbcd5c80e.avif?t=1787141592\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras_big/85c342d191f2735ce83cdd3fbcd5c80e.webp?t=1787141592 width=1560 height=81 /></span><br><br>Experience fast, tactical, and explosive ship-to-ship battles built around positioning, timing, and powerful weapon loadouts.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853730/extras/2bb4719ef3db72